TITLE:: Command
SUMMARY:: Base representation of a command with named parameters and an execution action.
CATEGORIES:: Control
RELATED:: Classes/AmpCommand, Classes/CommandPrompt, Classes/Parameter, Classes/SnapCommand, Classes/WriteCommand

DESCRIPTION::
TELETYPE::Command:: represents an executable command. It defines a name, a list of accepted LINK::Classes/Parameter:: instances, and an optional execution action LINK::Classes/Function::. Ad-hoc instances pass an action to LINK::#*new::. Subclasses such as LINK::Classes/AmpCommand::, LINK::Classes/SnapCommand::, and LINK::Classes/WriteCommand:: override LINK::#-execute:: instead of passing an action.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Creates a new TELETYPE::Command::.

ARGUMENT:: name
A LINK::Classes/String:: or LINK::Classes/Symbol:: naming the command.

ARGUMENT:: parameters
An optional LINK::Classes/Array:: of LINK::Classes/Parameter:: instances that this command accepts (defaults to empty).

ARGUMENT:: action
An optional LINK::Classes/Function:: called on execution, receiving an arguments LINK::Classes/Dictionary:: or LINK::Classes/Event::.

RETURNS::
A new TELETYPE::Command:: instance.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: action
Returns the execution function for this command, if specified.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Function:: or CODE::nil::.

METHOD:: execute
Executes the command with the provided arguments dictionary.

ARGUMENT:: argsDict
A LINK::Classes/Dictionary:: or LINK::Classes/Event:: mapping parameter names to parsed argument values.

RETURNS::
The result of the action function, or CODE::nil::.

METHOD:: getParameter
Retrieves a parameter definition by name.

ARGUMENT:: paramName
A LINK::Classes/String:: or LINK::Classes/Symbol:: matching the parameter name.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Parameter:: instance, or CODE::nil:: if not found.

METHOD:: isValid
Returns whether all defined parameters have valid argument values in the given dictionary.

ARGUMENT:: argsDict
A LINK::Classes/Dictionary:: or LINK::Classes/Event:: containing argument values.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/Boolean::.

METHOD:: name
The name of the command.

RETURNS::
A LINK::Classes/String::.

METHOD:: parameters
The list of parameter definitions accepted by this command.

RETURNS::
An LINK::Classes/Array:: of LINK::Classes/Parameter:: instances.

PRIVATE:: init
